OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in car crash on busy
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 70s has died in a car
OL,7,Fcrash on a busy stretch of road, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police said it happened at
OL,11,Fabout 13:30 BST on Saturday on the A69
OL,12,Fbetween Haydon Bridge and Hexham.
OL,14,FThe force said the woman had been a
OL,15,Fpassenger in a Volkswagen Tiguan
OL,16,Ftravelling eastbound when it was in
OL,17,Fcollision with a black Honda coming
OL,18,Ffrom the opposite direction.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
